      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Result BE</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5917197382\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-backend-go/issues/222\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-backend-go/issues/222/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-backend-go/issues/222\">GoThruMedia/villume-backend-go#222</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">API Example Usage</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">1. Using cURL</h3>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Request:</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -X GET &quot;https://api-dev.villume.com/v1/auth/magic-link/verify?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">curl -X GET <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://api-dev.villume.com/v1/auth/magic-link/verify?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Success Response (<code class=\"notranslate\">200 OK</code>):</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;statusCode&quot;: 200,\n  &quot;data&quot;: {\n    &quot;valid&quot;: true,\n    &quot;messages&quot;: &quot;Login success&quot;,\n    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;OK&quot;,\n    &quot;token&quot;: &quot;eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3NjI5MDAwMDAsImlhdCI6MTc2MDI5MDAwMCwibHMiOiIyMDI2LTEwLTE5VDEyOjAwOjAwIiwicm9sZSI6InVzZXIiLCJzdWIiOiJkR1Z6ZEM1aFkybHVaUT09In0.ABC123xyz...&quot;,\n    &quot;username&quot;: &quot;johndoe&quot;,\n    &quot;is_email_verified&quot;: true,\n    &quot;is_welcome&quot;: true,\n    &quot;exp&quot;: 1762900000\n  }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">200</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Login success<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"status\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>OK<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"token\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE3NjI5MDAwMDAsImlhdCI6MTc2MDI5MDAwMCwibHMiOiIyMDI2LTEwLTE5VDEyOjAwOjAwIiwicm9sZSI6InVzZXIiLCJzdWIiOiJkR1Z6ZEM1aFkybHVaUT09In0.ABC123xyz...<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"username\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>johndoe<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"is_email_verified\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"is_welcome\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"exp\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">1762900000</span>\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Error: Expired or Invalid Token (<code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code>):</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;statusCode&quot;: 400,\n  &quot;data&quot;: {\n    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;BAD_REQUEST&quot;,\n    &quot;valid&quot;: false,\n    &quot;errors&quot;: {\n      &quot;messages&quot;: &quot;Magic link is invalid or has expired&quot;\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">400</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"status\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>BAD_REQUEST<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"errors\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Magic link is invalid or has expired<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Error: Already Used Link / Nonce Consumed (<code class=\"notranslate\">400 Bad Request</code>):</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-json notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;statusCode&quot;: 400,\n  &quot;data&quot;: {\n    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;BAD_REQUEST&quot;,\n    &quot;valid&quot;: false,\n    &quot;errors&quot;: {\n      &quot;messages&quot;: &quot;Magic link has already been used or has expired&quot;\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">{\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"statusCode\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">400</span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"data\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"status\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>BAD_REQUEST<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"valid\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"errors\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"pl-ent\">\"messages\"</span>: <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Magic link has already been used or has expired<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">2. Next.js / React Frontend Integration Example</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This example demonstrates how a Next.js / React page (e.g., <code class=\"notranslate\">app/auth/magic-link/verify/page.tsx</code>) consumes the link when clicked by the user:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-tsx notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"'use client';\n\nimport { useEffect, useState } from 'react';\nimport { useSearchParams, useRouter } from 'next/navigation';\nimport axios from 'axios';\n\ninterface VerifyLoginResponse {\n  statusCode: number;\n  data: {\n    valid: boolean;\n    messages: string;\n    status: string;\n    token: string;\n    username: string;\n    is_email_verified: boolean;\n    is_welcome: boolean;\n    exp: number;\n  };\n}\n\nexport default function MagicLinkVerifyPage() {\n  const searchParams = useSearchParams();\n  const router = useRouter();\n  const [errorMessage, setErrorMessage] = useState&lt;string | null&gt;(null);\n  const [isVerifying, setIsVerifying] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    const token = searchParams.get('token');\n\n    if (!token) {\n      setErrorMessage('Verification token is missing.');\n      setIsVerifying(false);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    async function verifyAndAuthenticate() {\n      try {\n        const response = await axios.get&lt;VerifyLoginResponse&gt;(\n          `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL}/v1/auth/magic-link/verify`,\n          {\n            params: { token },\n          }\n        );\n\n        const { token: sessionJwt } = response.data.data;\n\n        // Store session token in localStorage / cookie\n        localStorage.setItem('token', sessionJwt);\n\n        // Redirect user to dashboard\n        router.push('/dashboard');\n      } catch (err: any) {\n        const message =\n          err.response?.data?.data?.errors?.messages ||\n          err.response?.data?.data?.messages ||\n          'Failed to verify magic link. It may have expired or already been used.';\n        setErrorMessage(message);\n        setIsVerifying(false);\n      }\n    }\n\n    verifyAndAuthenticate();\n  }, [searchParams, router]);\n\n  if (isVerifying) {\n    return (\n      &lt;div className=&quot;flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;h1 className=&quot;text-xl font-semibold mb-2&quot;&gt;Verifying Magic Link...&lt;/h1&gt;\n        &lt;p className=&quot;text-gray-500&quot;&gt;Signing you into your account, please wait.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    &lt;div className=&quot;flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen text-center p-4&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h1 className=&quot;text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2&quot;&gt;Sign In Failed&lt;/h1&gt;\n      &lt;p className=&quot;text-gray-700 mb-6&quot;&gt;{errorMessage}&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;a\n        href=&quot;/login&quot;\n        className=&quot;px-6 py-2 bg-indigo-900 text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-indigo-800&quot;\n      &gt;\n        Back to Sign In\n      &lt;/a&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  );\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-s\">'use client'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">import</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">useEffect</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">useState</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">from</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">'react'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">import</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">useSearchParams</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">useRouter</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">from</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">'next/navigation'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">import</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">axios</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">from</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">'axios'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">interface</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">VerifyLoginResponse</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c1\">statusCode</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">number</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span>: <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">valid</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">boolean</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">messages</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">status</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">token</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">username</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">is_email_verified</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">boolean</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">is_welcome</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">boolean</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">exp</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">number</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">default</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">MagicLinkVerifyPage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">searchParams</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">useSearchParams</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">router</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">useRouter</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">errorMessage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">setErrorMessage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">useState</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">|</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">null</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">null</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">isVerifying</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">setIsVerifying</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">useState</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">useEffect</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">token</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">searchParams</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">get</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'token'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">token</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-en\">setErrorMessage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'Verification token is missing.'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-en\">setIsVerifying</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">async</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">verifyAndAuthenticate</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">try</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">response</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">await</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">axios</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">get</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">VerifyLoginResponse</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-s\">`<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">process</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">env</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>/v1/auth/magic-link/verify`</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-c1\">params</span>: <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> token <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">token</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">sessionJwt</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">response</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"pl-c\">// Store session token in localStorage / cookie</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-s1\">localStorage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">setItem</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'token'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">sessionJwt</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"pl-c\">// Redirect user to dashboard</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-s1\">router</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">push</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'/dashboard'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">catch</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">any</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">message</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">response</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">errors</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">messages</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">||</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-s1\">err</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">response</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">?.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">messages</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">||</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-s\">'Failed to verify magic link. It may have expired or already been used.'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-en\">setErrorMessage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">message</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-en\">setIsVerifying</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"pl-en\">verifyAndAuthenticate</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">searchParams</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">router</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">isVerifying</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen\"</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">h1</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\"</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>Verifying Magic Link...<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">h1</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">p</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"text-gray-500\"</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>Signing you into your account, please wait.<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">p</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">div</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen text-center p-4\"</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">h1</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\"</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>Sign In Failed<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">h1</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">p</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"text-gray-700 mb-6\"</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">errorMessage</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">p</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">a</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">href</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"/login\"</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">className</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"px-6 py-2 bg-indigo-900 text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-indigo-800\"</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n        Back to Sign In\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">a</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">div</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">3. Using TypeScript Function (Axios)</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-ts notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"import axios from 'axios';\n\nexport async function verifyMagicLinkToken(token: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {\n  const response = await axios.get(\n    `https://api-dev.villume.com/v1/auth/magic-link/verify`,\n    {\n      params: { token },\n    }\n  );\n\n  // Returns the standard 30-day Villume session JWT\n  return response.data.data.token;\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">import</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">axios</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">from</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">'axios'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">async</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">verifyMagicLinkToken</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">token</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">Promise</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">string</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">response</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">await</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">axios</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">get</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-s\">`https://api-dev.villume.com/v1/auth/magic-link/verify`</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-c1\">params</span>: <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> token <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"pl-c\">// Returns the standard 30-day Villume session JWT</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">response</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">token</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note: Local demo with mock data</p>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">Screencast.From.2026-10-20.11-53-23.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-4bb10812-d6f6-4ad9-80fe-4249c0c8efb9.mp4\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-4bb10812-d6f6-4ad9-80fe-4249c0c8efb9.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
